# Negative control: REAL furniture, verbatim from the uploaded drive transcripts
# of CI run 34766632019 (the FGS-publish, background-catchup and integration
# lanes), which is the run whose scan returned rc 1 on nothing but false
# positives. Selected line by line and reviewed against Rule 15: no hex run of
# eight or more, no bech32 or hex key material, no URL, host or address, no
# coordinate, no person or circle name, no wall-clock instant, and nothing the
# harness printed about the run (sentinels, connection ids, exact counts). What
# is left is furniture — tooling preamble, vendor chatter, Rust module paths,
# Dart and Java type names, durations, bucket tokens and alias handles — so a
# rule tightening that would redden a real lane goes red HERE first.
